%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H7_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I glance over at the mysterious horse figure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca644bccb10bda444bd0ff07812d3a81, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I thought that was just some kind of hallucination in the subway, but clearly
      there is a horse... person standing across the room.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can only see one of his eyes, but the brown orb captivates me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wait, is he coming closer?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I snap out of my trance and notice the horse-headed man heading in my direction.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Uhmm... What do I do? Should I leave?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Can you see me?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh? I mean... I would say he is quite hard to overlook.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Y\u2014 yes, I\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Really? Oh my! That is great!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm not sure how good I am at deciphering horse emotions but the expression
      on his face looks like relief to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am really confused and a bit unsettled.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You are probably really confused and a bit unsettled. Excuse me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wow, I've never met a mind reading reverse centaur before.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Actually, I am quite confused as well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Okay? I'm sorry about that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, it is not your fault, do not worry!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Let us make our way to a more secluded area of the bunker, otherwise bystanders
      might think you have some schizophrenic tendencies.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He leads the way to the edge of the room, behind some old metal shelving.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The matter is, that you seem to be the only one here who is able to see
      me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Is he for real? That would explain why nobody is freaking out about the
      elepha\u2014... I mean horse in the room."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But where are my manners? Let me introduce myself first. It is Your Royal
      Highness Prince van Ross.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Your name is Prince?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, I am Prince, the prince of our kingdom. You may call me Sir Prince.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Yeah\u2026 I think I'll call you Horse."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He looks at me with a slightly disgusted expression and murmurs something
      under his breath.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Such an animalistic name. But what else am I to expect from these people.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ecf4cd60f4aae9743a20a53929c6eb36, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 4
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "May I at the very least suggest something like\u2026 Mr. Horse? If it
      must be."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ecf4cd60f4aae9743a20a53929c6eb36, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I guess that is an acceptable compromise.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Alright, nice to meet you, Mr. Horse! My name is {playerName}.
    alternativeText: Alright, nice to meet you, Mr. Horse!
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The pleasure is mine, {playerName}. I saw you, by the way.
    alternativeText: The pleasure is mine. I saw you, by the way.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What do you mean?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In the subway.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh right, how could I forget my very first sighting of this peculiar being.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I noticed you looking at me, but I was unsure if you could truly see me.
      For a very long time now, I have seemed invisible to any human I come across.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think I see a hint of sadness hides behind his eyes, but he quickly shakes
      it off and moves on.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I tried to go after you, but I could not find you on the train anymore.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And now we cross paths again here. It must be fate or something of the
      sort.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't know if that's the case.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It is a bit weird though. Everything about this situation right now is
      very weird actually.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So, you mentioned your Kingdom. Where is that place? How did you come here?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I am not sure. It was always just home\u2026 And now it is gone. I do
      not know why. I just want to return home."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel sorry for Mr. Horse. It must be horrible for him to live in a foreign
      place where nobody even notices you. I am curious about his origins.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "So, is everyone from where you come from\u2026 like\u2026 an animal?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Suddenly, he freezes and takes a step back. It seems like his cold stare
      pierces right through me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is happening now?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Are you okay?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel well.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It certainly doesn't seem like that.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse continues to speak calmly, but in a more serious tone.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: To answer your question, no, I am nothing such as an animal and it would
      be pleasant if you could refrain from referring to me as such.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But yes, everyone living in our kingdom possesses some sort of hybrid features.
      I just happen to hold features of the most majestic of all, as all members
      of the royal family do.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The horse.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Okay, he seems to be a bit full of himself.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Still, many questions buzz around in my head. Maybe I should ask Mr. Horse\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d93d1b221f294905b0d856bb92349565, type: 2}
